{"vid": 340791361, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "reviews": [{"range": "34426-34431", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "26833324_84qCvIh1K", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "黄金非货币化是指取消黄金的货币职能（不再作为流通手段、支付手段、价值尺度的法定货币），仅保留商品属性和储备资产属性，核心标志是1976年《牙买加协议》的签署。\n关键背景：布雷顿森林体系（黄金-美元本位）崩溃后，美元与黄金脱钩，各国货币不再与黄金挂钩，汇率由市场供求决定，黄金退出国际货币流通领域，仅作为各国央行的储备资产和个人投资品", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "34426-34431", "abstract": "牙买加体系", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "26833324_84qCvIh1K", "userVid": 26833324, "topics": [], "createTime": 1762319391, "contextAbstract": "退出货币的历史舞台，牙买加体系建立的初期", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 26833324, "name": "吧啦吧啦哒哒哒", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-Mp5~UCENpz5FEBF42df2Q10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "吧啦吧啦哒哒哒", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 6}]}, {"range": "34516-34600", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "38009516_84MtjrAZj", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "2025年鹿死谁手呢", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "34590-34600", "abstract": "直至新的货币格局诞生", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "38009516_84MtjrAZj", "userVid": 38009516, "topics": [], "createTime": 1763560570, "contextAbstract": "金的碰撞中走向消亡，直至新的货币格局诞生", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 38009516, "name": "玉秀", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-XvJ5MMpXLm1we3kRRQ4uJf5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "玉秀", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "260503178_8bK0DUffW", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "在货币体系危机期间黄金每一次回调都是上车机会。2026年上半年是贵金属投资以来最艰难时刻多重利空黄金回撤了30%股票市场贵金属板块短短五个月平均回撤60%多，比历史任何一次熊市都惨烈，很多人割肉了，那么就等时间吧", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "34516-34600", "abstract": "历次货币体系危机期间都会有维系力量的出现，这体现在黄金价格上涨途中出现的反复，当维系力量不足以支撑其运作时，货币体系最终将在与黄金的碰撞中走向消亡，直至新的货币格局诞生", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "260503178_8bK0DUffW", "userVid": 260503178, "topics": [], "createTime": 1788072006, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 260503178, "name": "⛈️", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-vjTd9AJ5XNpIUl03jiW0a10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "⛈️", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "河伯见北海若", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-100", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "35085-35171", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 3, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_88oRRxqU4", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "现在美元体系造成的全球经济不平衡、贫富差距、贸易失衡、债务问题，并不是新问题。当年英镑当世界货币时就有这种问题，后来布雷顿森林体系（美元挂钩黄金）时也有，现在美元脱离黄金后只是把同样的毛病换了个形式继续存在。也就是说谁当世界中心货币谁就会占优势，谁就会制造全球失衡。\n现在的美元体系没有黄金背书，纯粹靠信用（纸本位），它从根子上就继承了以前货币体系会造成失衡的那个病根：\n1. 中心国家（美国）可以印钱享受全球商品\n2. 其他国家必须辛苦生产、赚美元、攒美元\n3. 全球贸易、资本流动永远不平衡\n4. 危机永远会周期性爆发", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "通过回溯近代金本位和布雷顿森林体系的运行，我们可以看到，维持货币体系运作的关键在于公信力和国际合作。", "range": "35121-35171", "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "254854030_88oRRxqU4", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1776306314, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 8}, {"reviewId": "281069799_88KYLmjF0", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "写在2016年特朗普孤立主义上台之前 回首过去10年 逆全球化已经是趋势了", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "35121-35171", "abstract": "通过回溯近代金本位和布雷顿森林体系的运行，我们可以看到，维持货币体系运作的关键在于公信力和国际合作。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "281069799_88KYLmjF0", "userVid": 281069799, "topics": [], "createTime": 1777562240, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 281069799, "name": "认真工作的古晉🐻", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/TKywGoQEbNwtLImOd1GvicZdy55OXq63Xckf1GhuFPia7C7eUUL6lRxTnPEPEb66gYxicCwXnFic6V8evX5ibibFzibEg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-100", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 100}}}}, {"reviewId": "16247623_82HaVKQ4u", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "所以美国搞逆全球化，根本是在自掘坟墓。除非他们真的缺心眼儿，所以所谓的逆全球化不过是幌子，为了对付我们打压我们故意制造舆论，拉帮结派。根本目的，还是要保住自己的货币垄断优势。可叹，被他拉帮结派的国家真的是鼠目寸光，为了蝇头小利不过长远利益，甘愿被收割。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "35085-35171", "abstract": "从黄金名义上退出货币流通和美元本位的建立，到2016年已经过去了40年。通过回溯近代金本位和布雷顿森林体系的运行，我们可以看到，维持货币体系运作的关键在于公信力和国际合作。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "16247623_82HaVKQ4u", "userVid": 16247623, "topics": [], "createTime": 1756216499, "userEditTime": 1756216644, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 16247623, "name": "黄建华", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/lpHDr05YrISgc8icw9ZIibpc8aC00b8ib3YxPdBAibmgcXibQ6FZYNuaBqxII53Y4QKfR2m7gZLVWldQ/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241028-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 3}]}, {"range": "35320-35361", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 4, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_88oSk4iGa", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "中心-外围国家利益格局不平衡：\n在美元主导的国际货币体系里美国作为中心国家，和其他发展中国家、普通外围国家之间形成了一种利益完全不对等、收益与风险严重倾斜的结构：美国可以靠印美元、发美债就享受全球商品和资源，掌握全球利率、汇率、资本流动的主导权，而外围国家只能靠廉价劳动力、出口资源和商品来赚取美元，还要被迫积累大量美元外汇储备承担美元升值贬值、美联储加息降息带来的所有外部冲击。一旦美国出现通胀或危机，它可以通过印钞、加息、贬值等方式把成本和风险转嫁给外围国家，自己享受铸币税和全球财富分配的优势地位，外围国家却只能被动承受汇率波动、资本外流、债务压力、经济动荡。整个格局从规则到利益分配都高度偏向中心国家，外围国家始终处于依附、被动、受损更多的位置。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "这种根源来自单一国别垄断货币必须面临的特里芬难题和中心-外围国家利益格局的不平衡。", "range": "35320-35361", "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "254854030_88oSk4iGa", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1776306735, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJP